  "id": "2026-09-20-browser-unit-ci-runtime",
  "problem_type": "Browser integration test runtime differs between developer machines and CI",
  "symptom": "PR #828 Unit fails on Linux before assertions: Chromium executable missing and macOS-only /private/tmp cache paths fail EACCES.",
  "direct_cause": "Vitest includes browser-backed test.mjs files but the Unit job never installs Chromium; three new test files hardcode a macOS temporary directory.",
  "class_root": "Each test execution lane must provision the runtime its selected tests actually use; temporary state must use the host platform and be isolated per fixture.",
